WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.169 --> 00:00:03.206
OF AUSTIN WHERE LAW ENFORCEMENT

00:00:00.903 --> 00:00:04.607
ARE SCRAMBLING COME THE RESINS

00:00:03.339 --> 00:00:06.642
THEY ARE WORRYING.

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:08.711
GOOD EVENING, JOHN.

00:00:06.776 --> 00:00:12.248
&gt;&gt; GOOD EVENING, BRET.

00:00:08.845 --> 00:00:12.782
THIS FEDEX STORE HAS BEEN AT THE

00:00:12.381 --> 00:00:14.917
CENTER OF WHAT IS AN

00:00:12.915 --> 00:00:16.919
INCREASINGLY URGENT SEARCH FOR

00:00:15.051 --> 00:00:17.653
WHOMEVER MAY BE BEHIND THE

00:00:17.053 --> 00:00:20.590
BOMBINGS WITH FEDERAL AND LOCAL

00:00:17.787 --> 00:00:24.260
LAW ENFORCEMENT FOCUSING ON THIS

00:00:20.723 --> 00:00:26.028
AND AT LEAST TWO OTHER MAJOR

00:00:24.393 --> 00:00:28.431
INVESTIGATIVE SITES AS THEY SEEK

00:00:26.162 --> 00:00:29.632
TO BRING AN END TO AUSTIN'S

00:00:28.865 --> 00:00:32.435
TERROR.

00:00:29.765 --> 00:00:35.638
&gt;&gt; WE'VE BEEN WORKING AROUND THE

00:00:32.568 --> 00:00:37.039
CLOCK, AGAIN, THE PUBLIC SAFETY

00:00:35.771 --> 00:00:39.141
IS OUR NUMBER ONE PRIORITY.

00:00:37.173 --> 00:00:40.610
&gt;&gt; SAFETY THAT WAS ONCE AGAIN

00:00:39.275 --> 00:00:41.210
CHATTERED AFTER ANOTHER

00:00:40.743 --> 00:00:45.448
EXPLOSION IN TEXAS.

00:00:41.344 --> 00:00:47.683
THIS TIME, AT A FEDERAL EXPRESS

00:00:45.581 --> 00:00:48.284
FACILITY IN SHERTZ, 20 MILES

00:00:47.817 --> 00:00:49.151
OUTSIDE OF SAN ANTONIO.

00:00:48.417 --> 00:00:51.554
&gt;&gt; THE PACKAGE HAD BEEN

00:00:49.285 --> 00:00:55.024
TRAVELING ALONG THE AUTOMATED

00:00:51.687 --> 00:00:55.758
CONVEYOR WHEN IT HAD EXPLODED.

00:00:55.157 --> 00:00:58.728
ONE EMPLOYEE THAT WAS STANDING

00:00:55.892 --> 00:01:00.596
NEAR THE EXPLOSION LATER

00:00:58.861 --> 00:01:00.897
COMPLAINED OF RINGING IN THE

00:01:00.730 --> 00:01:03.833
EARS.

00:01:01.030 --> 00:01:04.433
&gt;&gt; THE FBI BELIEVES THE PARCEL

00:01:03.966 --> 00:01:06.335
WAS DESTINED FOR AUSTIN.

00:01:04.567 --> 00:01:09.005
THEY ARE NOW INVESTIGATING AN

00:01:06.469 --> 00:01:10.439
AUSTIN AREA FEDEX STORE FOR

00:01:09.138 --> 00:01:11.607
WHERE THEY BELIEVE THE PACKAGE

00:01:10.573 --> 00:01:13.142
WAS SENT TO.

00:01:11.741 --> 00:01:16.078
THIS COMES JUST TWO DAYS AFTER A

00:01:13.276 --> 00:01:17.446
BLAST IN THE STATES CAPITAL

00:01:16.212 --> 00:01:19.048
INJURED TWO MAN.

00:01:17.580 --> 00:01:21.250
SUNDAY'S BOMBING SHOWING WHAT

00:01:19.181 --> 00:01:22.251
AUTHORITIES CALL A "HIGHER LEVEL

00:01:21.384 --> 00:01:24.420
OF SOPHISTICATION."

00:01:22.385 --> 00:01:25.988
IT WAS TRIGGERED BY A NEARLY

00:01:24.554 --> 00:01:27.623
INVISIBLE TRIPWIRE.

00:01:26.122 --> 00:01:29.191
&gt;&gt; THEY LOOKED SO HARD, THEY

00:01:27.757 --> 00:01:30.393
COULDN'T TELL, THEY TRIPPED AND

00:01:29.325 --> 00:01:30.927
SET OFF THIS EXPLOSION.

00:01:30.526 --> 00:01:34.230
THEY DIDN'T SEE IT.

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:35.665
IT WAS A WIRE.

00:01:34.363 --> 00:01:37.466
AND IT BLEW UP.

00:01:35.798 --> 00:01:39.969
YOU DON'T KNOW WHAT TO THINK

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:39.435
WITH SOMETHING LIKE THIS HAPPENS

00:01:39.435 --> 00:01:40.303
WITH SOMETHING LIKE THIS HAPPEN

00:01:40.102 --> 00:01:40.836
HAPPENS.

00:01:40.436 --> 00:01:43.406
IT'S UNCALLED FOR.

00:01:40.970 --> 00:01:44.206
&gt;&gt; THE PRESIDENT ECHOING THAT

00:01:43.539 --> 00:01:45.408
SENTIMENT AND OFFERING SUPPORT

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:47.877
FROM WASHINGTON.

00:01:45.541 --> 00:01:48.244
&gt;&gt; THE BOMBINGS IN AUSTIN ARE

00:01:48.010 --> 00:01:51.847
TERRIBLE.

00:01:48.377 --> 00:01:52.481
LOCAL STATE AND FEDERAL WORKING

00:01:51.981 --> 00:01:52.915
HAND-TO-HAND TO GET TO THE

00:01:52.615 --> 00:01:54.884
BOTTOM OF IT.

00:01:53.049 --> 00:01:58.621
THIS IS OBVIOUSLY A VERY, VERY

00:01:55.017 --> 00:01:59.021
SICK INDIVIDUAL OR MAY BE

00:01:58.754 --> 00:02:02.191
INDIVIDUALS.

00:01:59.155 --> 00:02:02.758
ARE SICK PEOPLE AND WE WILL GET

00:02:02.325 --> 00:02:05.828
TO THE BOTTOM OF IT.

00:02:02.892 --> 00:02:07.296
&gt;&gt; WITH A SERIAL BOMBER AT

00:02:05.962 --> 00:02:08.698
LARGE, HUNDREDS OF AGENTS FROM

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:10.466
THE ATF AND FBI AND ON THE

00:02:08.831 --> 00:02:12.268
LONE STAR STATE AND RACING

00:02:11.167 --> 00:02:14.003
AGAINST TIME, HOPING TO STOP

00:02:12.401 --> 00:02:15.838
THE PERSON WHO HAS KILLED THE

00:02:14.136 --> 00:02:17.306
TWO PEOPLE AND INJURED FOUR

00:02:15.972 --> 00:02:19.542
OTHERS THIS MONTH IN AUSTIN AND

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:22.311
WHO SOME INVESTIGATORS BELIEVE

00:02:19.675 --> 00:02:22.878
IT IS LIKELY LINKED TO THE DAYS

00:02:22.445 --> 00:02:25.715
BOMB BLAST IN SHERTZ.

00:02:23.012 --> 00:02:26.482
&gt;&gt; CERTAINLY COMMON SENSE TELLS

00:02:25.848 --> 00:02:27.516
YOU THAT IT'S VERY LIKELY

00:02:26.616 --> 00:02:29.585
CONNECTED AND I THINK WE WILL

00:02:27.650 --> 00:02:31.821
FIND OUT SOON THAT IT IS

00:02:29.719 --> 00:02:33.322
CONNECTED.

00:02:31.954 --> 00:02:36.859
&gt;&gt; OFFICIALS SAY IT IS CLEAR

00:02:33.456 --> 00:02:38.060
THAT WHOMEVER IS DOING THIS HAS

00:02:36.993 --> 00:02:40.029
CONSIDERABLE EXPERTISE.

00:02:38.194 --> 00:02:42.798
WHAT ISN'T CLEAR IS THAT MOTIVE

00:02:40.162 --> 00:02:43.699
AND TO MORE FRIGHTENINGLY,

00:02:42.932 --> 00:02:46.435
PERHAPS, WHEN AND WHERE THE

00:02:43.833 --> 00:02:46.836
BOMBER WILL STRIKE NEXT.

00:02:46.569 --> 00:02:48.270
BRET?

00:02:46.969 --> 00:02:49.338
&gt;&gt; Bret: JONATHAN, LEAVE THIS

00:02:48.404 --> 00:02:51.073
AFTERNOON, THE AUTHORITIES CAME

00:02:49.472 --> 00:02:52.475
BACK AND SAID THAT WAS NOT AN

00:02:51.207 --> 00:02:54.243
UNEXPLODED DEVICE, SO THEY

00:02:52.608 --> 00:02:54.610
WERE HOPING TO GET ONE THAT WAS

00:02:54.377 --> 00:02:55.378
INTACT.

00:02:54.744 --> 00:02:58.981
BUT THEY CAME OUT AND KIND OF

00:02:55.511 --> 00:03:02.218
CORRECTED THAT.

00:02:59.115 --> 00:03:03.152
&gt;&gt; YES, THE POLICE CHIEF IN

00:03:02.351 --> 00:03:05.655
SHERTZ HAD ORIGINALLY PUT OUT A

00:03:03.285 --> 00:03:08.057
STATEMENT SAYING THAT THEY HAD

00:03:05.788 --> 00:03:10.826
FOUND A DEVICE THAT DID NOT

00:03:08.190 --> 00:03:11.994
EXPLODE OUT OF LARGE FEDEX

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:13.429
FACILITY JUST BY SAN ANTONIO.

00:03:12.128 --> 00:03:14.497
THEY WALKED BACK BACK WITHIN

00:03:13.562 --> 00:03:17.600
ABOUT TWO OR THREE HOURS AND

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:18.000
SAID THEY HAD NOT FOUND A SECOND

